WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.440
My name is Emma and I live in Alberta, Canada.
我叫艾玛，住在加拿大艾伯塔省。

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:11.640
I started watching how I met your mother back in high school with my first love and we completely saw ourselves in Marshall and Lily.
我早在高中时就和我的初恋一起看《老爸老妈浪漫史》，当时我们觉得Marshall和Lily就是我们的缩影。

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:19.339
Unfortunately, like many first love situations, it ended quite painfully a few years later and I couldn't bring myself to watch the show for a long time.
不幸的是，就像许多初恋一样，几年后它以极其痛苦的方式结束了，很长一段时间我都无法说服自己去看这部剧。

00:00:19.339 --> 00:00:24.440
I'm 27 this year and I decided to rewatch alongside the podcast.
我今年27岁，我决定一边听播客一边重温这部剧。

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:37.640
I haven't had much luck in love over the last 10 years, so seeing Ted start his journey at 27 And reliving all these lessons and how I met your mother has really brought me back to who I am and reminded me how much is ahead of me still.
过去10年里，我在爱情上运气不太好，所以看到Ted在27岁开始他的旅程，重温所有这些人生教训以及《老爸老妈浪漫史》，真的让我找回了自我，并提醒我前方还有多么广阔的人生。

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:46.700
That line that Ted says in the limo episode, it's all important, it was all leaving somewhere, was a lesson I really needed to relearn in this season of life.
Ted在加长豪华轿车那一集里说的那句台词——“这一切都很重要，这一切都有迹可循”——是我在这个人生阶段真正需要重新领悟的一课。

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:53.700
As an adult, I'm now a filmmaker and I capture stories for a living and it's so clear to me now how much how I met your mother inspired me to pursue that path.
成年后，我现在是一名电影制片人，以捕捉故事为生，现在我非常清楚《老爸老妈浪漫史》在多大程度上启发我走上了这条路。

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:59.700
The show reaches people in all kinds of chapters and I feel so blessed that it's been with me through so many of mine.
这部剧触动了处于各种人生阶段的人，我感到非常幸运，它陪伴我度过了那么多的岁月。

