It's a huge and it has to be, it has to be perfect.
这是一个巨大的工程，而且必须做到完美。

00:11:47.741 --> 00:11:51.834
Like, that's the thing you have to nail and it really looked amazing.
这是你必须拿下的部分，它看起来真的很惊艳。

00:11:51.834 --> 00:11:55.808
It looked like it was a hilarious visual funny on mute as they say.
就像是一个即使静音也极其搞笑的视觉喜剧效果。

00:11:55.808 --> 00:12:07.433
Two things about that Murphy bed about the more kind of jumping a little bit through the episode but when they pull it down and it gets stopped at the wall and Ted is kind of like stuck behind it.
关于那个墨菲床有两件事，稍微有点跳跃到剧集后面的部分，当他们把它拉下来时，它被墙卡住了，泰德有点被夹在后面。

00:12:07.433 --> 00:12:18.406
I remember there are certain things that like the props and maybe the costumes or the production design is so good that it's kind of like it just elicits a very honest response for you.
我记得有些东西，比如道具、服装或制作设计太棒了，以至于它能激发你非常真实的反应。

00:12:18.406 --> 00:12:22.439
Like I remember when we pulled that bed down and it just gets stuck.
就像我记得当我们把那张床拉下来却被卡住的时候。

00:12:22.439 --> 00:12:26.710
And I watched, you know, Ted's body, which at the time was my body also.
我看着，你知道，泰德的身体，当时也是我的身体。

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:28.090
Really?
真的吗？

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:31.285
Just kind of, you know, do this response that I know that was not...
就是那种，你知道，做出了我知道并非……

00:12:31.285 --> 00:12:34.481
I know it was different every time I did it because it was such a...
我知道我每次做这个反应都不一样，因为这是一个……

00:12:34.309 --> 00:12:35.877
It seemed that there was legitimate danger.
看起来好像真的有危险。

00:12:35.877 --> 00:12:37.590
Like maybe it could have gotten out of control.
就好像它可能会失控一样。

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.682
That's why I brought your staff to stuff with so good.
这就是为什么我说你们的工作人员那么厉害。

00:12:39.682 --> 00:12:40.534
No one did get killed.
虽然没有人真的丧命。

00:12:40.534 --> 00:12:42.898
But it did legitimately, like, it really fell open that well.
但它确实看起来很真实，它弹开得那么好。

00:12:42.898 --> 00:12:45.029
There was really, there was some physics at work there.
那里面真的运用了一些物理原理。

00:12:45.029 --> 00:12:54.539
And I can see that and hitting a real, having a real response, you know, and it must have been, you know, fun for the production staff when they're like, you describe this apartment, you describe what the bed is.
我能看到那个并做出真实的反应，你知道，对于制作人员来说一定很有趣，当他们听到你描述这个公寓，描述这张床的时候。

00:12:54.539 --> 00:12:57.590
Like, they have to do some real, like, engineering and measurements.
他们必须进行真正的工程设计和测量。

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:00.451
That is no small feat what they did without wall ripping open.
要在不把墙真的撕开的情况下做到这一点，可真不是一件小事。

00:13:00.451 --> 00:13:01.190
It looked great.
它看起来棒极了。

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:01.886
Oh, yeah.
