00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.504
Yeah, it's always in the New Yorker.
对，他的作品总是在《纽约客》上发表。

00:13:11.504 --> 00:13:14.395
I'm friendly with him and he sent me his books.
我和他关系很好，他给我寄了他的书。

00:13:14.395 --> 00:13:17.101
He sent me his first book called This Is Me.
他寄给我他的第一本书叫《这就是我》。

00:13:17.101 --> 00:13:23.374
And then there's a sequel that I was delighted to come home last night and discover he had sent to me.
然后还有第二本，我昨晚回家发现他寄给我了，感到非常高兴。

