So I spent this morning reading the second book of cartoons and they're so funny.
所以我今天早上花时间读了第二本漫画书，它们太搞笑了。

00:13:28.123 --> 00:13:34.269
Shout out to Asher Pearlman and worth well worth picking up a copy and giving it to your friends.
向阿舍·珀尔曼致敬，非常值得买一本送给你的朋友。

