But the guy who was on the other side of the wall that was ripped looks so much like like an Asha Perlman character.
但是墙被撕开的另一边那个家伙，长得太像阿舍·珀尔曼笔下的角色了。

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.169
He does look like a cartoon in that guy.
