00:13:46.169 --> 00:13:47.169
It was a New Yorker cartoon.
那是《纽约客》杂志的一幅漫画。

00:13:47.169 --> 00:13:50.289
There's people in these cartoons that are like, that's the guy.
这些漫画里有些人会让人觉得，就是那个家伙。

00:13:50.289 --> 00:13:51.289
That's the guy.
就是那个家伙。

00:13:51.289 --> 00:13:52.289
That's the guy.
就是那个家伙。

00:13:52.289 --> 00:13:53.289
He had a great look that guy.
